{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Obfuscation</strong></i> is a first person horror game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Escaping from a car trunk, you find yourself in the garage of an unfamiliar house, with no memory of who you are or how you got there. Step inside and explore to uncover the truth that someone - or something - is trying to keep hidden in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/6c734273b3f2d0a4f776947a35731ffc.poster.avif?t=1761648343\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/6c734273b3f2d0a4f776947a35731ffc.webm?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/6c734273b3f2d0a4f776947a35731ffc.mp4?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Obfuscation</i>, most of the time you\u2019ll be free to explore a vast, eerie house while trying to piece together what\u2019s really happening. However, the house doesn\u2019t stay still \u2014 it keeps shifting and changing, pulling you further away from reality as you go deeper and closer to the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment that lets you immerse in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-burn horror experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay, no complex mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 1\u20132 hours of playtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle storytelling that lets you piece things together yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be no direct hints telling you what to do or where to go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There won\u2019t be any long story text to read.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.poster.avif?t=1761648343\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.webm?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.mp4?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/22b25c969ef622183f5e36dea26f134f.poster.avif?t=1761648343\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/22b25c969ef622183f5e36dea26f134f.webm?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/22b25c969ef622183f5e36dea26f134f.mp4?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains some scenes with flashing lights throughout the game and may not be suitable for players with light sensitivity.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3119050?t=1761648343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761648343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/5fa9fe65e18c4616d4b05979f14c348a7bcd5d46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761648343","capsule_imagev5":"http