9s really happening. However, the house doesn\u2019t stay still \u2014 it keeps shifting and changing, pulling you further away from reality as you go deeper and closer to the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment that lets you immerse in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-burn horror experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay, no complex mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 1\u20132 hours of playtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle storytelling that lets you piece things together yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be no direct hints telling you what to do or where to go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There won\u2019t be any long story text to read.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.poster.avif?t=1761648343\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.webm?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/07b2cbcdd66779231a8e7d8f47615c8f.mp4?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/22b25c969ef622183f5e36dea26f134f.poster.avif?t=1761648343\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/22b25c969ef622183f5e36dea26f134f.webm?t=1761648343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/